# The popup dialogs (BasePop with its Dialog, buttons and key handling): the quit question that the Escape
# key brings up over the game menu, a Tab that moves its focus, the mouse over a button, and Escape to answer
# it, then the same question again answered with the Return key. Loaded from the game's autosave. Leave time
# after each step; the snaps take 2 s each.
25 load
42 snap note
48 click 362 734         # the note's Close
49 snap map
66 click 63 538          # MENU
70 snap menu
73 key Escape            # closes the menu, then asks to quit
77 snap quit-dialog
79 key Tab               # the focus moves to another button
82 snap quit-tab
84 key Escape            # answers the question
88 snap map-after-cancel
91 click 63 538          # MENU
95 key Escape            # the question again
99 snap quit-again
101 move 500 300
103 key Return           # the default button
107 snap map-after-return
110 close
